title: A rightward turn?
new-page: true
subtitle: The PSL-P meets with the ChZJN.
tags: event
view-if: year >= 1923 and month >= 3 and instability >= 5
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: lanckorona_seen = 1
face-image: img/Piast_Concept.jpg

= A rightward turn?

Following deep political instability produced by the failure of the Sejm to build a stable governing majority[? if president != 'Wojciechowski' and president != "Zamoyski" : and the result of the presidential election. ?]

The parties will meet in Warsaw to discuss how to approach the current problems plaguing **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">and</span>**.

- @discuss: The parties discuss...

@discuss
go-to: lanckorona_pact if psl_p_right >= (psl_p_left + (psl_p_relation*(4/100)))

The PSL-P discusses with the ChZJN...

- @compromise: The ChZJN attempts to compromise with the PSL-P

@compromise
subtitle: The PSL-P is unconvinced on a political alliance.

The ChZJN promises to increase tariffs and support more pro-agricultural policies in the government.

- @deal: The PSL-P decides.
- @nuh_uh: The PSL-P decides.

@nuh_uh
view-if: (psl_p_right + 2) < (psl_p_left + (psl_p_relation*(4/100)))
on-arrival: psl_p_left += 3; psl_p_relation += 10; psl_w_right += 3

After more diplomatic exchange, the PSL-P remains in cooperation with like-minded parties with the PSL-W, NPR and us — the PPS.

This is both good news to our parties cooperation and also strengthens the peasant unity in the Sejm.

@deal
view-if: (psl_p_right + 2) >= (psl_p_left + (psl_p_relation*(4/100)))
go-to: lanckorona_pact
on-departure: lanckorona_pact_compromise = 1

After more diplomatic exchange, the PSL-P will be given more ministries and pursue increased tariffs in government, and Thus,

@lanckorona_pact
on-arrival: lanckorona_pact = 1; psl_p_ideology = 'Right'; psl_p_left -= 2; psl_p_relation -= 25; peasants_psl_p += 5

The two parties have reached an agreement, they will both pursue a formation of a parliamentary majority.

The agreement [? if lanckorona_pact_compromise == 1 : also ?] stipulated that numerus clausus should be applied in education, agricultural expropriation will be accelerated by at least 200,000 hectares per year, there will be increased **<span style="color: #CCC;">Poloni</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">zation</span>** of the Eastern Borderlands and other right-wing reforms.

This represents a significant [? if lanckorona_pact_compromise != 1 : and irreversible ?] shift of the PSL-P to the right.
